866
00:49:15.370 --> 00:49:17.371
- [Duffy over phone] <i>Reacher.</i>
- I'm in the cellar.

867
00:49:17.372 --> 00:49:19.248
<i>Is Teresa there?</i>

868
00:49:24.003 --> 00:49:25.088
No.

869
